WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.424
Statin intolerance: practical options.

2
00:00:03.874 --> 00:00:09.122
Separating true intolerance from nocebo effects, and the alternatives when statins fail.

3
00:00:09.572 --> 00:00:12.056
High-intensity statins remain first line.

4
00:00:12.506 --> 00:00:16.372
Adherence falls quickly, so early follow-up and lipid checks help.

5
00:00:16.822 --> 00:00:22.720
Ezetimibe, PCSK9-targeted therapy and other agents help patients who remain above target.

6
00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:29.347
Very high LDL or early family history should prompt assessment for an inherited cause and cascade testing.
